    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "John Giltinane Auctioneer & Associates are delighted to present to the market this charming traditional 2-bedroom semi-detached cottage located at Kilbeg, Kilfinny, Adare, Co. Limerick.\r\n\r\nSet on circa 0.91 acres, this delightful countryside property offers a wonderful opportunity for those seeking a peaceful rural lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of Adare and surrounding amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property retains its traditional character, beginning with a charming stable entrance door leading into a cozy living/sitting room complete with a solid fuel stove, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nLiving / Sitting Room\r\n\r\n12.31 ft x 13.78 ft (Approx. 169.53 sq. ft.)\r\nSolid fuel stove\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n\r\n6.86 ft x 9.82 ft (Approx. 67.33 sq. ft.)\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\n\r\n9.96 ft x 6.01 ft (Approx. 59.84 sq. ft.)\r\nBath\r\nTiled flooring\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n\r\n10.23 ft x 14.04 ft (Approx. 143.62 sq. ft.)\r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n\r\n14.02 ft x 12.68 ft (Approx. 177.77 sq. ft.)\r\nSpacious double bedroom with timber flooring\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nOccupying a generous circa 0.91-acre site, the property offers excellent outdoor space with plenty of potential for gardening, or future enhancement (subject to the necessary planning permission).\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property is a useful storage shed measuring approximately 9.44 ft x 16.29 ft (153.70 sq. ft.).\r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains water supply\r\nSeptic tank\r\nSolid fuel heating\r\nLarge site extending to approximately 0.91 acres\r\n\r\nThis attractive cottage offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or anyone seeking a charming country residence with ample outdoor space in a highly sought-after location close to Adare.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment through John Giltinane Auctioneer & Associates."
      },
